{"unit_id":"nzl153__dsh-pet-whale#card-zh","repo":"nzl153/dsh-pet-whale","commit":"231a1936c427e0fae1d34ebb3942aa342192ffb6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"pet-whale（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：一只随 DSH 会话活动变化的桌宠鲸鱼。它接入客户端通道，订阅会话、对话与会话状态快照，并在页面中绘制可交互的 DOM 宠物。主要功能包括根据思考、工具工作、完成、错误和等待状态切换动画，多会话跟随，拖动与游动，外观大小和配色调整，以及完成提醒、音效和陪伴统计。适合希望在网页使用 DSH 时直观看到 agent 状态并进行轻量互动的用户。无需 API key 或外部账号；状态偏好保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-4","src/client/index.ts:21","src/client/index.ts:2040-2086","src/client/state.ts:1-4"]}
{"unit_id":"nzl153__dsh-pet-whale#card-en","repo":"nzl153/dsh-pet-whale","commit":"231a1936c427e0fae1d34ebb3942aa342192ffb6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"pet-whale (DSH web plugin) is an interactive whale that reflects session activity, including thinking, tool use, completion, and errors. It can follow multiple sessions and supports movement, customization, reminders, and sounds. No API key is needed; preferences stay in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-4","src/client/index.ts:21","src/client/index.ts:2040-2086","src/client/state.ts:1-4"]}
